[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1299:b005:l029","ordinal":176385,"en":"Your uncle has words to say"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1299:b005:l030","ordinal":176386,"en":"And the skill to offer counsel."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1299:b005:l031","ordinal":176387,"en":"Chynkojo, son of Shygai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1299:b005:l032","ordinal":176388,"en":"Khojo, resolute in his deeds—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1299:b005:l033","ordinal":176389,"en":"We shared one camp from the beginning,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1299:b005:l034","ordinal":176390,"en":"And grew up together from youth."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1299:b005:l035","ordinal":176391,"en":"An enemy who takes up the cudgel is bad;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1299:b005:l036","ordinal":176392,"en":"An enemy who shared your camp is bad;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1299:b005:l037","ordinal":176393,"en":"Worst is the dog Khojo who knows your secrets."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1299:b005:l038","ordinal":176394,"en":"He escaped after coming out to shoot;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1299:b005:l039","ordinal":176395,"en":"Khojo, a proven enemy, is the worst."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l001","ordinal":176396,"en":"Trouble arose from a place without trouble;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l002","ordinal":176397,"en":"Alas, Khojo emerged as an enemy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l003","ordinal":176398,"en":"He began the havoc"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l004","ordinal":176399,"en":"And slaughtered your uncle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l005","ordinal":176400,"en":"Mountainous as Opol-Too."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l006","ordinal":176401,"en":"My dear Külchoro,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l007","ordinal":176402,"en":"Chynkojo, son of Shygai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l008","ordinal":176403,"en":"Has set my sorrow boiling,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l009","ordinal":176404,"en":"And truly brought upon my head"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l010","ordinal":176405,"en":"This marvel that will be my death."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l011","ordinal":176406,"en":"The moon is dark; night has come;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l012","ordinal":176407,"en":"My wise Choro, hear this:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l013","ordinal":176408,"en":"The day of death has come."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l014","ordinal":176409,"en":"Dear Khojo has grown mighty,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l015","ordinal":176410,"en":"Overpowering honored men."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l016","ordinal":176411,"en":"Of Buurul beneath me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l017","ordinal":176412,"en":"Only a spoonful of blood remains,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l018","ordinal":176413,"en":"His flesh a blue, battered pulp."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l019","ordinal":176414,"en":"My powder has spilled from its flask;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l020","ordinal":176415,"en":"I have despaired of this grieving life."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l021","ordinal":176416,"en":"No host remains for close combat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l022","ordinal":176417,"en":"No bullet remains for shooting—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l023","ordinal":176418,"en":"Can God strike us so?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l024","ordinal":176419,"en":"Let us dress him in Akolpok,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l025","ordinal":176420,"en":"Mount him upon Aktelki,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l026","ordinal":176421,"en":"And offer Aichürök as tribute;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l027","ordinal":176422,"en":"Safe and sound to Talas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l028","ordinal":176423,"en":"Let us turn back now!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l029","ordinal":176424,"en":"Let us speak words of conciliation,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l030","ordinal":176425,"en":"Saying, “Here, take Chürök,”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l031","ordinal":176426,"en":"And before Toltoi"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l032","ordinal":176427,"en":"Let us offer Aichürök,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l033","ordinal":176428,"en":"Then return safely to our camp!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l034","ordinal":176429,"en":"Perhaps we should agree to his demand,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l035","ordinal":176430,"en":"Saying, “We were kin—pardon us,”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l036","ordinal":176431,"en":"And offer Arbuurul and Akkelte"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l037","ordinal":176432,"en":"As tribute to Khojo."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l038","ordinal":176433,"en":"Perhaps we should give tribute and withdraw,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b003:l039","ordinal":176434,"en":"Without crushing battle with the dog,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l001","ordinal":176435,"en":"And return safely to Talas.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l002","ordinal":176436,"en":"When the prince spoke thus,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l003","ordinal":176437,"en":"As though stabbed in the eye,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l004","ordinal":176438,"en":"Külchoro sprang up:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l005","ordinal":176439,"en":"“Chynkojo, son of Shygai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l006","ordinal":176440,"en":"Khojo, whose path is strife!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l007","ordinal":176441,"en":"Worse than a fire burning the meadow"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l008","ordinal":176442,"en":"Is an enemy sprung from one’s own;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l009","ordinal":176443,"en":"Worse is an illness sprung from the core,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l010","ordinal":176444,"en":"Worse is Khojo, the enemy who fights to the death."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l011","ordinal":176445,"en":"My dear uncle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l012","ordinal":176446,"en":"Who would listen to these words of yours?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l013","ordinal":176447,"en":"Let some black night listen;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l014","ordinal":176448,"en":"Let the dug black grave listen."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l015","ordinal":176449,"en":"Who else would listen to them!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l016","ordinal":176450,"en":"Let the uncrossable black water listen;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l017","ordinal":176451,"en":"Who else would listen!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l018","ordinal":176452,"en":"Do not dig my deep grave,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l019","ordinal":176453,"en":"My dear uncle;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l020","ordinal":176454,"en":"Do not set my sorrow boiling!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l021","ordinal":176455,"en":"How could I bow my head"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l022","ordinal":176456,"en":"And hand my sister-in-law to Khojo,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l023","ordinal":176457,"en":"With whom we have shed blood?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l024","ordinal":176458,"en":"How could I turn my neck,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l025","ordinal":176459,"en":"And offer a heroic soul,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l026","ordinal":176460,"en":"Saying, ‘Let him be’?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l027","ordinal":176461,"en":"Rather than see such suffering,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l028","ordinal":176462,"en":"I shall die fighting."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l029","ordinal":176463,"en":"Akkelte was treasure left by my father—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l030","ordinal":176464,"en":"How could I give it away?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l031","ordinal":176465,"en":"The hell that has come upon my head"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l032","ordinal":176466,"en":"I shall face with my own eyelashes!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l033","ordinal":176467,"en":"While my strong head remains,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l034","ordinal":176468,"en":"How could I give my swift horse"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l035","ordinal":176469,"en":"To the blustering Khojo?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l036","ordinal":176470,"en":"Let what I have gathered remain in my hand,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l037","ordinal":176471,"en":"Let my faith be my companion;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l038","ordinal":176472,"en":"I shall not withdraw where death has not come."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1300:b004:l039","ordinal":176473,"en":"Until the soft reeds ripen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l001","ordinal":176474,"en":"Until the flower of divine law flies,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l002","ordinal":176475,"en":"I shall fight firmly for six months."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l003","ordinal":176476,"en":"While my able head remains,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l004","ordinal":176477,"en":"How could I give up my sister-in-law?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l005","ordinal":176478,"en":"With that earth-scorching dog,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l006","ordinal":176479,"en":"Let me grapple neck to neck."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l007","ordinal":176480,"en":"Able uncle, what are you saying?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l008","ordinal":176481,"en":"Let a dog listen to these words!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l009","ordinal":176482,"en":"My valiant mother Kanykei"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l010","ordinal":176483,"en":"Entrusted something carefully;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l011","ordinal":176484,"en":"These were my mother’s words:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l012","ordinal":176485,"en":"‘A single bullet left by Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l013","ordinal":176486,"en":"I sewed into the collar"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l014","ordinal":176487,"en":"Of Akolpok,’ she said."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l015","ordinal":176488,"en":"Binding it back and fastening it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l016","ordinal":176489,"en":"When we returned this way,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l017","ordinal":176490,"en":"My dear mother Kanykei"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l018","ordinal":176491,"en":"Entrusted it to Akolpok."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l019","ordinal":176492,"en":"As we came this way,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l020","ordinal":176493,"en":"She grasped my hand and held me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l021","ordinal":176494,"en":"My beloved mother,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l022","ordinal":176495,"en":"And, saying, ‘If grave trouble befalls you,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l023","ordinal":176496,"en":"Remember your father,’ entrusted it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l024","ordinal":176497,"en":"Binding and securing it again;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l025","ordinal":176498,"en":"My beloved Kanykei"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l026","ordinal":176499,"en":"Entrusted it to orphaned me."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l027","ordinal":176500,"en":"When we lived in Talas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l028","ordinal":176501,"en":"We herded horses at Kanjailak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l029","ordinal":176502,"en":"And shot the soaring vulture"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l030","ordinal":176503,"en":"Before it could reach us."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l031","ordinal":176504,"en":"Once I came blazing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l032","ordinal":176505,"en":"Into this world;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l033","ordinal":176506,"en":"With the gun left by my father,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l034","ordinal":176507,"en":"I had the skill of a marksman.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l035","ordinal":176508,"en":"From the hard-pressed sultan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l036","ordinal":176509,"en":"Young prince Külchoro"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l037","ordinal":176510,"en":"Asked for Akkelte,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l038","ordinal":176511,"en":"Striking him with words like these."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b003:l039","ordinal":176512,"en":"Your valiant prince and sultan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l001","ordinal":176513,"en":"Unable to say, “I will not give it,”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l002","ordinal":176514,"en":"And not wishing to thwart the hero,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l003","ordinal":176515,"en":"Dismounted and gave him Buurul,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l004","ordinal":176516,"en":"Unfastened and gave him the treasured gear."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l005","ordinal":176517,"en":"Semetey gave them to the hero."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l006","ordinal":176518,"en":"Look at the form of that desperate man:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l007","ordinal":176519,"en":"In his Kokon mottled coat,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l008","ordinal":176520,"en":"He ran crouching along the road,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l009","ordinal":176521,"en":"His knees bending to the ground;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l010","ordinal":176522,"en":"The prince did not stop but ran,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l011","ordinal":176523,"en":"Flaring in fury,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l012","ordinal":176524,"en":"The prince fleeing in great strides,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l013","ordinal":176525,"en":"Surpassing his former valor,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l014","ordinal":176526,"en":"Running straight ahead,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l015","ordinal":176527,"en":"And hiding in a black cave."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l016","ordinal":176528,"en":"When he reached the black cave,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l017","ordinal":176529,"en":"The dear hero born to surpass"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l018","ordinal":176530,"en":"His father, gray-wolf Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l019","ordinal":176531,"en":"Hid his whole body,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l020","ordinal":176532,"en":"Sticking out his head as large as a hearth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l021","ordinal":176533,"en":"Hiding his dark body,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l022","ordinal":176534,"en":"Sticking out his head like a crow."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l023","ordinal":176535,"en":"As hail poured down,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l024","ordinal":176536,"en":"Streaming from Chynkojo,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l025","ordinal":176537,"en":"Despairing of his fly-like life,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l026","ordinal":176538,"en":"True Manas’s only son"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l027","ordinal":176539,"en":"Took shelter in the black cave."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l028","ordinal":176540,"en":"Hero Semey, son of Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l029","ordinal":176541,"en":"Was hidden from sight,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l030","ordinal":176542,"en":"Concealed in the black cave,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l031","ordinal":176543,"en":"His whereabouts unknown."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l032","ordinal":176544,"en":"Having gone to hide in the cave—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l033","ordinal":176545,"en":"Such was Semetey’s ordeal;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l034","ordinal":176546,"en":"His poor life had come under strain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l035","ordinal":176547,"en":"Else would a hero act this way?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l036","ordinal":176548,"en":"Now let us tell"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l037","ordinal":176549,"en":"The tale of Külchoro:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l038","ordinal":176550,"en":"A servant perfectly skilled in judgment,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1301:b004:l039","ordinal":176551,"en":"Strange and singular from childhood,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l001","ordinal":176552,"en":"A mighty servant who knew the enemy’s stratagems."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l002","ordinal":176553,"en":"Akkelte, entrusted and left"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l003","ordinal":176554,"en":"By his father, noble Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l004","ordinal":176555,"en":"With a seven-jointed brass ramrod—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l005","ordinal":176556,"en":"Your hero drew it out."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l006","ordinal":176557,"en":"Saying, “Its bore has become dirty,”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l007","ordinal":176558,"en":"He scraped it with a file,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l008","ordinal":176559,"en":"Pounded it with a striker,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l009","ordinal":176560,"en":"Pulled it with a draw-tool;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l010","ordinal":176561,"en":"Without tiring, Külchoro"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l011","ordinal":176562,"en":"Cleaned and wiped its inside."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l012","ordinal":176563,"en":"Once the bore was clean,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l013","ordinal":176564,"en":"Külchoro took"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l014","ordinal":176565,"en":"A large cloth from the gray kise"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l015","ordinal":176566,"en":"And pulled it through again and again."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l016","ordinal":176567,"en":"The half-bullet sewn into the collar,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l017","ordinal":176568,"en":"And the half-charge of powder,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l018","ordinal":176569,"en":"Into Akkelte’s muzzle"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l019","ordinal":176570,"en":"He now poured by the palmful."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l020","ordinal":176571,"en":"The half-bullet in his hand—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l021","ordinal":176572,"en":"Taking the bronze ramrod,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l022","ordinal":176573,"en":"He drove it down with a ringing blow."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l023","ordinal":176574,"en":"Gripping the gun at the waist,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l024","ordinal":176575,"en":"Displaying his valor,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l025","ordinal":176576,"en":"He swore a firm oath then,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l026","ordinal":176577,"en":"Touching his mouth to its muzzle:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l027","ordinal":176578,"en":"“My bloodthirsty father was a lion-warrior;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l028","ordinal":176579,"en":"Akkelte remained from him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l029","ordinal":176580,"en":"If I fail to shoot"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l030","ordinal":176581,"en":"Chynkojo, son of Shygai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l031","ordinal":176582,"en":"May my father’s spirit"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l032","ordinal":176583,"en":"Strike me down in the end;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l033","ordinal":176584,"en":"If you fail to hit where I point you,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l034","ordinal":176585,"en":"May my sultan father’s spirit"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l035","ordinal":176586,"en":"Find and strike you in the end!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l036","ordinal":176587,"en":"Having sworn his oath with Akkelte,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l037","ordinal":176588,"en":"Külchoro hurried away."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l038","ordinal":176589,"en":"Saying, “The stallion left by my father,”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b003:l039","ordinal":176590,"en":"He pleaded with Taibuurul:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l001","ordinal":176591,"en":"“I spread my hands to the holy sage;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l002","ordinal":176592,"en":"Be my blessing, Taibuurul."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l003","ordinal":176593,"en":"I have met an overwhelming foe;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l004","ordinal":176594,"en":"Be my father, Taibuurul."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l005","ordinal":176595,"en":"My mother remains far away;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l006","ordinal":176596,"en":"My beloved Taibuurul,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l007","ordinal":176597,"en":"Protect me as a mother.”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l008","ordinal":176598,"en":"His noble lord’s Akolpok,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l009","ordinal":176599,"en":"With golden collar and copper sleeves,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l010","ordinal":176600,"en":"Which no bullet pierced when worn in battle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l011","ordinal":176601,"en":"Külchoro took"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l012","ordinal":176602,"en":"And now draped crosswise"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l013","ordinal":176603,"en":"Over Taibuurul."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l014","ordinal":176604,"en":"The great reins tied in a loop"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l015","ordinal":176605,"en":"He flung trailing ahead;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l016","ordinal":176606,"en":"Külchoro, a master of judgment,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l017","ordinal":176607,"en":"Now entered upon his stratagem."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l018","ordinal":176608,"en":"Beside the moonlike stallion’s"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l019","ordinal":176609,"en":"Fat flank he took shelter;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l020","ordinal":176610,"en":"Covering himself with one skirt of the armor,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l021","ordinal":176611,"en":"He lay watching Khojo."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l022","ordinal":176612,"en":"The lion-born Choro’s"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l023","ordinal":176613,"en":"Eyes reddened like fire,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l024","ordinal":176614,"en":"His neck stretched like a drake’s;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l025","ordinal":176615,"en":"The gray kise that fell from heaven"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l026","ordinal":176616,"en":"Was slung around his neck."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l027","ordinal":176617,"en":"He pleaded with the spirits"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l028","ordinal":176618,"en":"Of the lions gone to the other world."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l029","ordinal":176619,"en":"Early words became late;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l030","ordinal":176620,"en":"For one exchange of shots"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l031","ordinal":176621,"en":"With Chynkojo, son of Shygai,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l032","ordinal":176622,"en":"His two eyes became four with eagerness."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l033","ordinal":176623,"en":"His gaze clouded in a strange way;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l034","ordinal":176624,"en":"From behind the white saddle’s pommel,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l035","ordinal":176625,"en":"He edged Akkelte’s muzzle out"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l036","ordinal":176626,"en":"So slightly one could scarcely tell."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l037","ordinal":176627,"en":"He promised a sheep to Koroson,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l038","ordinal":176628,"en":"Promised a horse to the holy sage,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1302:b004:l039","ordinal":176629,"en":"And to the spirits of the lions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1303:b003:l001","ordinal":176630,"en":"Quickly promised a white-gray mare."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1303:b003:l002","ordinal":176631,"en":"Saying, “God, set my grave task right;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1303:b003:l003","ordinal":176632,"en":"My valiant father Almambet,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1303:b003:l004","ordinal":176633,"en":"May your spirit support me now."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1303:b003:l005","ordinal":176634,"en":"This one too was a lion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1303:b003:l006","ordinal":176635,"en":"Chubak, son of Akbaltai;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1303:b003:l007","ordinal":176636,"en":"Girded at the solitary pass,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1303:b003:l008","ordinal":176637,"en":"If there were an army of seven divisions,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1303:b003:l009","ordinal":176638,"en":"He entered lightly clothed and attacked."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1303:b003:l010","ordinal":176639,"en":"Syrgak, son of Ulak Khan,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1303:b003:l011","ordinal":176640,"en":"May God set my task right;"}]
